{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror game about working the night shift at a haunted sandwich shop where you must figure out what happened to the previous night shift employee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work night by night over the course of a work week to solve the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to serve customers while dealing with scares and other chores that pop up throughout the night like cleaning and taking out the trash.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the week the orders will get more complex. From a few select sandwiches on the first night to custom sandwiches and salads later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016290/extras/e9feec3176a565d2a29c8beb466b51fe.avif?t=1764288547\" width=1560 height=406 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After finishing the main game there is a challenge mode where the goal is to serve 15 customers without succumbing to randomized enemies and events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4016290?t=1764288547","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4016290?t=1764288547","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016290/136dc44ef0410430d19b036e84bfad0464030eb0/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764288547","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016290/136dc44ef0410430d19b036e84bfad0464030eb0/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764288547","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains themes of stalking, depictions of skeletons and getting chased by a murderer. No gore or blood."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horror game about working the night shift at a haunted sandwich shop where you must figure out what happened to the previous night shift employee.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work night by night over the course of a work week to solve the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You need to serve customers while dealing with scares and other chores that pop up throughout the night like cleaning and taking out the trash.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you progress through the week the orders will get more complex. From a few select sandwiches on the first night to custom sandwiches and salads later.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016290/extras/e9feec3176a565d2a29c8beb466b51fe.avif?t=1764288547\" width=1560 height=406 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After finishing the main game there is a challenge mode where the goal is to serve 15 customers without succumbing to randomized enemies and events.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["TravisFatMan"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4016290/88557070275508b2771c7242a2b2e2c02de05c76/header.jpg?t=1764288547","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4016290/1673045508/85a8058cbda6bf65874af0338bcd804fb3017dc9/1759339523/dash_av1.mpd?t=1760138190","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4016290/1673045508/85a8058cbda6bf65874af0338bcd804fb3017dc9/1